Package: qore-ssh-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-ssh-module-doc
Description: SSH servers, authentication and virtual SFTP providers for Qore
 This package provides native libssh server/key bindings and compiled/source
 server authentication, connection, command and virtual SFTP provider modules.
 It includes compiler metadata, provider resources and translations. Servers
 are created explicitly by applications; installing the package starts none.

Package: qore-ssh-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-ssh-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's SSH server modules
 This package contains HTML API references, example programs and test fixtures
 for Qore SSH servers and virtual SFTP providers. Included keys are public
 test identities and must never be used for real deployments.
